#: src/YQPackageSelectorBase.cc:187
msgid ""
"<p>You can choose to install anyway if you know what you are doing, but you "
"risk getting a corrupted system that requires manual repairs. If you are not "
"absolutely sure how to handle such a case, press <b>Cancel</b> now and "
"deselect some packages.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Če veste kaj počnete, lahko vseeno izberete namestitev; a tvegate "
"okvarjen sistem, ki zahteva ročna popravila. Če niste popolnoma prepričani "
"kako ravnati v takem primeru, kliknite <b>Prekliči</b> in odstranite izbiro "
"nekaterih paketov.</p>"

#: src/YQPackageSelectorBase.cc:195
msgid "C&ontinue Anyway"
msgstr "Vs&eeno nadaljuj"

