#. Translators: Headline for help about the package manager in general
#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:65
msgid "The YaST Package Manager"
msgstr "Upravljalnik paketov za YaST"

#. Translators: Automatic word-wrapping.
#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:68
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> This is a just a short  overview. Refer to the manual for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"<b>Opomba:</b> To je le kratek pregled. Za podrobnosti poglejte v priročnik."

#. Help specific to online update mode
#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:75
msgid "In this dialog, select patches to download and install."
msgstr "V tem pogovornem oknu izberite popravke za prejem in namestitev."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:76
msgid ""
"The list on the left side contains available patches along with the "
"respective patch kind (security, recommended, or optional) and the "
"(estimated) download size."
msgstr ""
"Seznam na levi vsebuje razpoložljive popravke skupaj z ustrezno vrsto "
"popravka (varnostni, priporočljivi ali izbirni) in (ocenjeno) velikost "
"prejema."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:79
msgid ""
"This list normally contains only those patches that are not installed on "
"your system yet. You can change that with the <b>Include Installed Patches</"
"b> check box below the list."
msgstr ""
"Seznam običajno vsebuje le tiste popravke, ki še niso nameščeni v vašem "
"sistemu. To lahko spremenite s izbirnim stikalom <b>Vključi nameščene "
"popravke</b> pod seznamom."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:81
msgid ""
"The <b>Patch Description</b> field contains a longer explanation of the "
"currently selected patch. Click a patch in the list to view its description "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Polje <b>Opis popravka</b> vsebuje daljše pojasnilo o trenutno izbranem "
"popravku. S klikom na popravek na seznamu dobite tu njegov opis."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:83
msgid ""
"The package list on the right side shows the contents of the currently "
"selected patch, i.e., the packages it contains. You cannot install or delete "
"individual packages from a patch, only the patch as a whole. This is "
"intentional to avoid system inconsistencies."
msgstr ""
"Seznam paketov na desni kaže vsebino trenutno izbranega popravka, tj. "
"pakete, ki jih vsebuje. Iz popravka ne morete namestiti ali zbrisati "
"posameznega paketa, le popravek kot celoto. To je narejeno namenoma v izogib "
"neskladju sistema."

#. Translators: Please keep the reference to "filter views" to distinguish between "filter views" that
#. affect the amount of visible packages in the package list and "details views" ( below the package list )
#. that show details about the ( one ) currently selected package in the package list.
#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:91
msgid ""
"In addition to <b>Patches</b>, you can also select one of the other filter "
"views from <b>Filter</b> at the upper left:"
msgstr ""
"Poleg <b>Popravki</b> lahko iz padajočega seznama <b>Filter</b> zgoraj levo "
"izberete tudi enega od filtrov:"

#. Help specific to normal (non-online-update) mode
#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:99
msgid ""
"In this dialog, select which packages to install, update, or delete. You can "
"select individual packages or entire package \"selections\"."
msgstr ""
"V tem pogovornem oknu izberite pakete za namestitev, posodobitev ali "
"brisanje. Izberete lahko posamezne pakete ali celoten »izbor« paketov."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:101
msgid ""
"Click the status icon for a package or selection to change the status or "
"right-click it to open a context menu."
msgstr ""
"Za spremembo stanja kliknite na ikono stanja za paket ali izbiro, ali "
"kliknite z desnim gumbom, da se odpre vsebinski meni."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:103
msgid ""
"Use the <b>Check Dependencies</b> button to resolve package dependencies. "
"Some packages require other packages to be installed. Some packages can only "
"be installed if certain other packages are not installed, too. This check "
"will automatically mark required packages for installation and it will warn "
"you if there are dependency conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Za razrešitev odvisnosti med paketi uporabite gumb <b>Preveri odvisnosti</"
"b>. Nekateri paketi zahtevajo namestitev drugih paketov. Nekatere pakete pa "
"se lahko namesti le, če določeni drugi paketi niso nameščeni. To preverjanje "
"bo samodejno označilo pakete za namestitev in vas opozorilo, če je prišlo do "
"sporov v zvezi z odvisnostmi."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:108
msgid ""
"When you leave this dialog with <b>Accept</b>, this check will automatically "
"be performed."
msgstr ""
"Ko s <b>Sprejmi</b> zapustite to pogovorno okno, se bo preverjanje samodejno "
"izvršilo."

#. Translators: Please keep the reference to "filter views" to distinguish between "filter views" that
#. affect the amount of visible packages in the package list and "details views" (below the package list)
#. that show details about the (one) currently selected package in the package list.
#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:114
msgid ""
"Select one of the available filter views with the <b>Filter</b> combo-box at "
"the upper left:"
msgstr ""
"Izberite enega od razpoložljivih filtrirnih prikazov s spustnega polja "
"<b>Filter</b> zgoraj levo:"

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:118
msgid ""
"<b>Selections</b> shows some predefined sets of packages that logically "
"belong together."
msgstr ""
"<b>Izbori</b> prikazujejo nekaj vnaprej izbranih naborov paketov, ki logično "
"sodijo skupaj."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:119
msgid ""
"Use the check box next to the selection to select it as a whole. You can "
"also select or deselect individual packages in the package list at the right."
msgstr ""
"Za izbor kot celoto uporabite potrditveno stikalo poleg izbora. Posamezne "
"pakete lahko izberete ali odstranite njihov izbor v seznamu paketov na desni."

#. Help common to all modes: Description of the various filter views
#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:127
msgid ""
"<b>Package Groups</b> shows packages by category. You can expand and "
"collapse tree items to refine or generalize categories. Click any category "
"to display the packages in that category in the package list on the right "
"side."
msgstr ""
"<b>Skupine paketov</b> prikazujejo pakete po kategorijah. Za podrobnejši ali "
"splošnejši izbor kategorij lahko drevesne elemente razširite ali skrčite."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:130
msgid ""
" <b>Hint:</b> There is a \"zzz All\" entry at the very end of the list that "
"will show all packages. This may take a few seconds on slow machines."
msgstr ""
" <b>Naming:</b>Na koncu seznama je vnos \"zzz Vse\", ki prikaže vse pakete. "
"Na počasnih računalnikih lahko to traja nekaj sekund."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:133
msgid ""
"<b>Search</b> allows you to search for packages that meet various criteria. "
"This is usually the easiest way to find a package if you know its name."
msgstr ""
"<b>Iskanje</b> vam omogoča iskanje paketov, ki ustrezajo različnim "
"kriterijem. Če poznate ime paketa, je to običajno najlažja pot, da ga "
"najdete."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:135
msgid ""
"<b>Hint:</b> You can also use this to find out what package contains a "
"certain library.  Search in the <b>Provides</b> RPM field."
msgstr ""
"<b>Namig:</b> To lahko uporabite tudi za ugotavljanje, kateri paket vsebuje "
"določeno knjižnico. Iščite v polju <b>Zagotavlja</b>."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:138
msgid ""
"<b>Installation Summary</b> by default shows the changes to your system -- "
"what packages will be installed, deleted, or updated."
msgstr ""
"<b>Povzetek namestitve</b> privzeto prikaže spremembe v vašem sistemu — "
"kateri paketi bodo nameščeni, zbrisani ali posodobljeni."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:140
msgid ""
"It is generally a good idea to use <b>Check Dependencies</b> then switch to "
"<b>Installation Summary</b> before clicking <b>Accept</b>. This way you can "
"see all changes that will be made to your system."
msgstr ""
"V splošnem je dobro uporabiti <b>Preveri odvisnosti</b>, zatem pa preklopiti "
"na <b>Povzetek namestitve</b>, preden kliknete <b>Sprejmi</b>. Tako lahko "
"vidite vse spremembe, ki bodo opravljene v sistemu."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:143
msgid ""
"You can also explicitly select what packages with what status to see here; "
"use the check boxes at the left side."
msgstr ""
"Izrecno lahko tudi izberete, katere pakete in s kakšnim stanjem boste videli "
"tu; uporabite izbirna stikala na levi."

#: src/YQPackageSelectorHelp.cc:145
msgid ""
"<b>Hint:</b> You can also reverse the effect of this filter. You can see "
"what packages remain the same on your system. Simply check <b>Keep</b> and "
"uncheck everything else."
msgstr ""
"<b>Namig:</b> Učinek tega filtra lahko tudi obrnete. Vidite lahko, kateri "
"paketi bodo v vašem sistemu ostali nespremenjeni. Označite samo <b>Obdrži</"
"b> in odstranite oznake vsepovsod drugod."

#. Make sure all images used here are specified in
